    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakazi wa Yerusalemu walimpa Ahazia, mwana mdogo wa Yehoramu, ufalme, atawale mahali pa baba yake kwa sababu wakubwa wake wote waliuawa na kikundi fulani kilichokuja kambini pamoja na Waarabu. Hivyo, Ahazia mwana wa Yehoramu, mfalme wa Yuda, akatawala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazia, alianza kutawala akiwa mwenye umri wa miaka arubaini na miwili, akatawala kutoka Yerusalemu kwa muda wa mwaka mmoja. Mama yake aliitwa Athalia, mjukuu wa Omri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Omri:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maandiko mengine: Ahabu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu mama yake alikuwa mshauri wake katika kutenda maovu, naye pia alifuata mienendo ya jamaa ya Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitenda maovu mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu kama vile jamaa ya Ahabu ilivyofanya kwani hao ndio waliokuwa washauri wake baada ya kifo cha baba yake, hata aangamie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata alifuata shauri lao, akaenda pamoja na mfalme Yehoramu mwana wa Ahabu mfalme wa Israeli kupigana na Hazaeli mfalme wa Shamu huko Ramoth-gileadi. Nao Washamu walimjeruhi Yoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akarudi Yezreeli ili apate kutibiwa majeraha aliyoyapata huko Rama, wakati alipopigana na Hazaeli mfalme wa Shamu. Naye Ahazia mwana wa Yehoramu mfalme wa Yuda alimtembelea Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu huko Yezreeli kwa sababu alikuwa mgonjwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini hiyo ilikuwa imepangwa na Mungu kuwa maangamizi yampate Ahazia kwa njia hiyo ya kumtembelea Yoramu. Maana alipofika huko, alitoka pamoja na Yoramu kwenda kupigana na Yehu mwana wa Nimshi ambaye Mwenyezi-Mungu alimteua kuuangamiza uzao wa Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Yehu alipokuwa akiwahukumu jamaa ya Ahabu alikutana na wakuu wa Yuda pamoja na wana wa ndugu zake Ahazia, waliomtumikia Ahazia, akawaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimtafuta Ahazia, naye akakamatwa akiwa amejificha huko Samaria. Walimleta hadi kwa Yehu, akauawa. Waliuzika mwili wake kwani walisema, “Yeye ni mjukuu wa Yehoshafati, ambaye alimtafuta Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa moyo wake wote.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapakubaki hata mtu mmoja wa jamaa ya Ahazia ambaye angeweza kuwa falme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara Athalia, mamake Ahazia, alipoona kuwa mwanawe ameuawa, alitoka akaangamiza jamii yote ya kifalme ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Yehosheba, binti ya mfalme Yehoramu alimchukua Yoashi, akamtwaa kwa siri kutoka miongoni mwa wana wa mfalme waliokuwa karibu kuuawa. Alimficha yeye pamoja na yaya wake, katika chumba cha kulala. Hivyo Yehosheba, binti ya mfalme Yehoramu, mke wa kuhani Yehoadani, kwa sababu alikuwa dadaye Ahazia, alimficha Yoashi ili Athalia asimuue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye alikaa nao kwa muda wa miaka sita akiwa amefichwa ndani ya nyumba ya Mungu wakati Athalia alipokuwa akitawala nchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
